      "en": "$tscsepi_rate5"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "$tscsepi_rate5 (0.72%) is the second-band rate of the basic old-age pension insurance contribution for self-employed artisans and industry-and-trade workers, applied to income above the PSS ceiling and paired with $tscsepi_rate4 as the first band. It is used as the Band_Rate in the same tscse_fr/SchedCalc 'ARTISAN & I&T: Pension insurance contributions...(MAIN)' function, and matches the theme document's 2026 above-ceiling old-age rate (contributions.md: '0.72% above', up from 0.6% in 2025)."
    },
